@format 1
@id queue.create-audio-work
@title Create active audio work
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Create one audio job from the active source and current processing plan, preserving preset, tab, and relay state.
@flow TB
@related queue.create-saved-audio-work, audio.save-plan

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio
@alias audio = Cadroue.Application.LAudio
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Audio tab requests work <input>
- Receive the active source, current audio plan, output preset, and relay routing @ ui.LAudioDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build audio item <decision>
- Convert the preset, validate the source and plan, and create one audio work item @ audio.LAudioItemCreate(...)
? "The source or plan cannot produce work" > rejected
? "An audio item is created" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Add the item with source-tab and relay lineage @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the queue result @ ui.LAudioDescribe(...)
> result

[result] Audio work queued <output>
= The current audio plan appears as pending work.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No audio work record is added.
